---
description: >-
  The style keys the other fixtures leave out: `stroke`, `stroke-width` and
  `fill-opacity` on each set, and a `fill`, `fill-opacity` and `color` on the
  overlap, which v12 fills only when it is styled.
---
venn-beta
  set A
  set B
  union A, B["Both"]
  style A stroke:#d62728, stroke-width:2, fill-opacity:0.3
  style B stroke:#1f77b4, stroke-width:8, fill-opacity:0.05
  style A, B fill:#ffbf00, fill-opacity:0.6, color:#333333
